"smart_blocks:99.System/InboxArchive/2026-08/I Connected Claude to 3 Real Client Power BI Models Via MCP. Here's What It Caught - and What It Got Wrong.md##Over the past two months, I’ve used Claude + Microsoft’s Power BI Modeling MCP server (currently in public preview) on three real client engagements — a manufacturing distributor, a pharma supply chain client, and a financial services firm. Three different industries. Three different model maturities. Three very different findings. One was a genuine catch I would have missed in a manual audit. One was a false positive that pointed at a real issue elsewhere. One was simply faster validation of work I’d already done. Here’s what actually happened, what each finding teaches about how to use AI in BI workflows responsibly, and the honest disclosures about how I ran these without exposing client data.": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":"187fzfm","at":1785687442294},"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.10750524,0.00134595,-0.03013083,-0.05373397,-0.02561039,-0.03581798,0.00949888,0.00974591,0.08564018,-0.01185373,0.09932517,-0.06608572,-0.01031788,0.00997112,0.04785962,0.02477839,0.03596465,-0.02996755,0.01146001,0.0093163,0.01207921,-0.03320798,-0.0473369,0.00564476,0.04246685,-0.00232056,-0.01370395,-0.05962741,-0.06388118,-0.2506294,-0.00137441,0.00853617,0.04607248,-0.04706851,0.03453673,0.01257221,-0.01431929,0.06198431,-0.00959464,-0.01057125,0.01683291,0.01086914,0.05418707,-0.03478016,0.00528992,-0.02936513,0.04826869,0.02728629,0.03425279,-0.04718701,0.04017616,-0.02454904,0.00555046,0.0921334,0.0402059,0.03022567,0.05699644,0.03700723,0.04505125,0.04309044,0.03078242,0.08220755,-0.20624921,0.06347235,0.08031085,0.10269362,-0.02617579,-0.01768267,-0.00598141,0.01972361,-0.07214779,-0.04011297,-0.0908886,0.02599567,0.00626174,-0.04971759,0.035512,0.02263238,-0.03561092,-0.00160039,-0.04558387,0.01468292,-0.02799509,0.04728323,-0.06290134,0.02618678,0.01675095,0.00641951,0.015233,-0.06881094,-0.0610